724
00:25:06,668 --> 00:25:08,269
GRACEFULLY.

725
00:25:08,269 --> 00:25:09,637
Matthew: OH, OH, CAREFUL!

726
00:25:09,637 --> 00:25:10,772
CAREFUL, CAREFUL,
CAREFUL!

727
00:25:10,772 --> 00:25:11,873
SELL ME THAT FACE.

728
00:25:11,873 --> 00:25:13,575
