842
00:28:53,961 --> 00:28:55,196
IT'S ALL RIGHT.

843
00:28:55,196 --> 00:28:56,197
THIS IS
WORKING.

844
00:28:56,197 --> 00:28:57,165
THIS IS REALLY
WORKING.

845
