WILL BE ELIMINATED."

867
00:29:35,470 --> 00:29:37,438
LIKE, "YEAH, OKAY,
WE KNOW THAT. DUH."

868
00:29:37,438 --> 00:29:40,441
BUT, YOU KNOW, DESPITE THE FACT
