TO YOU.

906
00:31:07,027 --> 00:31:08,895
AND I DID SO GOOD.

907
00:31:08,895 --> 00:31:11,164
I WAS LIKE,
"THIS IS FOR MY FATHER."

908
00:31:11,164 --> 00:31:13,400
I'M NOT GOING HOME.

909
00:31:13,400 --> 00:31:15,235
SOMEBODY ELSE
GOTTA GO.

910
00:31:23,276 --> 00:31:24,911
Tyra: HELLO, EVERYBODY.

911
00:31:24,911 --> 00:31:27,380
WE ARE ONE STEP CLOSER
IN DETERMINING WHO WILL BE

912
00:31:27,380 --> 00:31:28,982
AMERICA'S NEXT
TOP MODEL.

913
00:31:28,982 --> 00:31:30,850
WE HAVE
SOME FABULOUS PRIZES--

914
00:31:30,850 --> 00:31:34,054
A CONTRACT WITH THE TOP
INTERNATIONAL MODELING AGENCY

915
00:31:34,054 --> 00:31:35,355
FORD MODELS,

916
00:31:35,355 --> 00:31:37,090
A SPREAD
IN "ELLE" MAGAZINE

917
00:31:37,090 --> 00:31:40,093
WHICH WILL BE PHOTOGRAPHED BY
WORLD-RENOWNED PHOTOGRAPHER...

918
00:31:40,093 --> 00:31:41,728
Janice: GILLES BENSIMON.

919
00:31:41,728 --> 00:31:43,163
Tyra: EXACTLY.

920
00:31:43,163 --> 00:31:47,267
AND A $100,000 CONTRACT
WITH COVER GIRL COSMETICS.

921
00:31:47,267 --> 00:31:49,002
NOW WE HAVE
SOME VERY INTERESTING JUDGES--

922
00:31:49,002 --> 00:31:50,270
MISS JANICE DICKINSON,

923
00:31:50,270 --> 00:31:51,771
ONE OF THE WORLD'S FIRST
SUPERMODELS.

924
00:31:51,771 --> 00:31:54,174
NIGEL BARKER,
A NOTED FASHION PHOTOGRAPHER.

925
00:31:54,174 --> 00:31:55,175
Nigel: HELLO, LADIES.

926
00:31:55,175 --> 00:31:56,643
Tyra: NOLE MARIN,

927
00:31:56,643 --> 00:31:58,645
PROMINENT FASHION EDITOR
AND STYLIST.

928
00:31:58,645 --> 00:31:59,813
Nolé: LADIES.

929
00:31:59,813 --> 00:32:01,147
Tyra: AND, OF COURSE,
OUR SPECIAL GUEST JUDGE,

930
00:32:01,147 --> 00:32:02,649
MATTHEW JORDAN SMITH.

931
00:32:02,649 --> 00:32:05,018
FIRST, JANICE WILL ADMINISTER
YOUR TEST.

932
00:32:05,018 --> 00:32:08,254
Janice: HERE'S THE SURPRISE
YOU'LL BE WORKING WITH.

933
00:32:08,254 --> 00:32:11,391
HIS NAME IS LANNY,
OUR MALE MODEL.

934
00:32:11,391 --> 00:32:12,959
Women: (laugh)

935
00:32:12,959 --> 00:32:14,327
Janice: HI, LANNY.

936
00:32:14,327 --> 00:32:17,130
Eva: OH, HELL, YEAH.

937
00:32:17,130 --> 00:32:18,998
Janice: A PHOTOGRAPHER
WILL BE TAKING PHOTOGRAPHS

938
00:32:18,998 --> 00:32:20,333
OF YOU POSING
WITH LANNY.

939
00:32:20,333 --> 00:32:23,403
YOU'LL BE JUDGED
ON HOW WELL YOU POSE.

940
00:32:23,403 --> 00:32:25,038
TOCCARA,
YOU'RE FIRST.

941
00:32:25,038 --> 00:32:26,372
Carissa: READY
WHEN YOU ARE.

942
00:32:26,372 --> 00:32:28,007
Toccara: SO, UM,
THIS IS MY CANVAS--I JUST--

943
00:32:28,007 --> 00:32:30,376
(laughs)

944
00:32:33,179 --> 00:32:35,915
Ann: STAND FORWARD.

945
00:32:35,915 --> 00:32:37,817
JUST STAND RIGHT THERE.

946
00:32:37,817 --> 00:32:39,352
AND THEN...

947
00:32:39,352 --> 00:32:40,920
Norelle:
ON YOUR KNEES.

948
00:32:48,161 --> 00:32:50,196
Jennipher:
OKAY, LET'S SEE.

949
00:32:55,268 --> 00:32:57,303
Amanda: IT'S GETTING
KINDA CLOSE.

950
00:32:57,303 --> 00:32:58,071
FORWARD.

951
00:33:02,008 --> 00:33:02,842
Cassie:
LET'S DO THIS.

952
00:33:02,842 --> 00:33:06,179
TURN AROUND.

953
00:33:06,179 --> 00:33:07,413
Nicole: HELLO.

954
00:33:11,784 --> 00:33:12,852
Kelle: CAN YOU HOLD
MY WEIGHT?

955
00:33:12,852 --> 00:33:14,154
Lanny: MM-HMM.

956
00:33:14,154 --> 00:33:15,355
Kelle: OKAY,
STAND STILL.

957
00:33:15,355 --> 00:33:16,890
NO, YOU'RE GONNA HOLD ME.

958
00:33:16,890 --> 00:33:17,924
Lanny: HOLD YOUR FOOT?

959
00:33:17,924 --> 00:33:19,792
Kelle: LIKE THAT.

960
00:33:19,792 --> 00:33:21,194
(whispers)
HOLD MY WEIGHT.

961
00:33:26,633 --> 00:33:28,968
Tyra: WE ARE GOING TO START
WITH TOCCARA.

962
00:33:28,968 --> 00:33:31,871
AND WE'RE GOING TO SEE
YOUR PHOTOS NOW.

963
00:33:31,871 --> 00:33:33,339
Janice: YOU LOOKED LIKE

964
00:33:33,339 --> 00:33:34,674
YOU WERE GOING TO THROW HIM
OVER YOUR SHOULDERS

965
00:33:34,674 --> 00:33:35,975
LIKE A CAVEWOMAN.

966
00:33:35,975 --> 00:33:37,410
Nigel: YOU NEED TO BE
MORE NATURAL, LESS DRAMATIC.

967
00:33:37,410 --> 00:33:39,112
Tyra: I DISAGREE
WITH ALL OF YOU GUYS.

968
00:33:39,112 --> 00:33:41,247
LOOK AT HER ARCH
OF HER BACK.

969
00:33:41,247 --> 00:33:42,749
LOOK AT THE BUST.

970
00:33:42,749 --> 00:33:43,950
LOOK AT
HER BODY.

971
00:33:43,950 --> 00:33:44,951
IT LOOKS RETOUCHED.

972
00:33:44,951 --> 00:33:46,186
HER BODY
LOOKS RETOUCHED.

973
00:33:46,186 --> 00:33:47,720
I LIKE IT.

974
00:33:47,720 --> 00:33:50,123
YOU DID A PHOTO SHOOT,
AND YOU WERE ON ROLLER SKATES.

975
00:33:50,123 --> 00:33:52,358
HERE IS YOUR BEST SHOT.

976
00:33:52,358 --> 00:33:53,993
Nolé: TOCCARA,
THERE'S NO SEX APPEAL

977
00:33:53,993 --> 00:33:56,796
IN THAT SHOT AT ALL,
AND YOU ARE SO SEXY.

978
00:33:56,796 --> 00:33:59,365
HERE YOU JUST LOOK LIKE
YOU'RE WAITING FOR THE BUS.

979
00:33:59,365 --> 00:34:01,634
