"I LIKE TO DISCO," YOU KNOW?

980
00:34:01,634 --> 00:34:03,836
AND GOTTEN THAT FEELING
AND SWINGING THE BAG, HONEY.

981
00:34:03,836 --> 00:34:06,139
Tyra: NORELLE.

982
00:34:06,139 --> 00:34:07,307
Janice: OH, MY GOD.

983
00:34:07,307 --> 00:34:08,675
ENGAGE
IN THE BOY.

984
00:34:08,675 --> 00:34:10,176
EW!

985
00:34:10,176 --> 00:34:12,277
Tyra: (laughs)
Nigel: THAT WAS SCARY.

986
00:34:12,277 --> 00:34:13,313
Tyra: ROLLER SKATING
IN THE ROLLER RINK.

987
00:34:13,313 --> 00:34:15,114
Nigel: YOUR EYES
AND YOUR FACE SOLD US.

988
00:34:15,114 --> 00:34:17,083
Tyra: DAMN,
NORELLE'S GORGEOUS.

989
00:34:17,083 --> 00:34:19,252
YOU KNOW,
SEXY.

990
00:34:19,252 --> 00:34:21,721
Tyra: ALL RIGHTY,
UP NEXT WE HAVE JENNIPHER.

991
00:34:21,721 --> 00:34:25,757
I THOUGHT YOU HID BEHIND HIM
AND HAD NO INTENSITY WHATSOEVER.

992
00:34:25,757 --> 00:34:27,025
Janice: THIS SCARES ME.

993
00:34:27,025 --> 00:34:30,029
Matthew: JENNIPHER,
OUT OF ALL THE GIRLS YESTERDAY,

994
00:34:30,029 --> 00:34:32,098
I THOUGHT YOU GAVE ME
THE LEAST.

995
00:34:32,098 --> 00:34:33,632
Nigel: YOU HAVE AN INCREDIBLE
FACE FOR MAKEUP.

996
00:34:33,632 --> 00:34:34,801
YOUR FACE LOOKS GOOD.

997
00:34:34,801 --> 00:34:36,268
Janice: WHY DO YOU WANNA BE
A MODEL?

998
00:34:36,268 --> 00:34:38,771
Jennipher: WE WENT THROUGH
THIS LAST WEEK.

999
00:34:38,771 --> 00:34:41,674
Janice: WHAT?

1000
00:34:41,674 --> 00:34:43,943
Tyra: IT DOES LOOK LIKE
YOU DON'T WANNA BE THERE.

1001
00:34:43,943 --> 00:34:47,112
IT LOOKS LIKE YOU'RE JUST
"SKATING" THROUGH.

1002
00:34:47,112 --> 00:34:48,214
ALL RIGHTY,
UP NEXT WE HAVE EVA.

1003
00:34:48,214 --> 00:34:49,949
Nolé: EVA THE DIVA
NEEDS TO COME OUT.

1004
00:34:49,949 --> 00:34:51,818
Tyra: LANNY IS SHOWING YOU UP
ON YOUR SHOTS.

1005
00:34:51,818 --> 00:34:53,652
HERE IS YOUR BEST SHOT.

1006
00:34:53,652 --> 00:34:55,321
Nigel: IT'S NICE TO SEE YOU
PERHAPS TAKE A LITTLE RISK.

1007
00:34:55,321 --> 00:34:57,190
