1009
00:34:58,691 --> 00:34:59,759
Nigel: THAT WAS
YOUR HAIR?

1010
00:34:59,759 --> 00:35:01,027
Eva: YEAH.

1011
00:35:01,027 --> 00:35:01,961
Janice: WHY DIDN'T HE PUT
THAT HAT ON YOUR HEAD

1012
00:35:01,961 --> 00:35:03,663
INSTEAD OF YOUR FACE?

1013
00:35:03,663 --> 00:35:04,864
Eva: THAT WAS THE LOOK
HE WAS GOING FOR.

1014
00:35:04,864 --> 00:35:07,300
Tyra: I LIKE THE FACT
THAT YOU DID NOT BLAME HIM.

1015
00:35:07,300 --> 00:35:08,401
Nigel: REALLY, ME TOO.

1016
00:35:08,401 --> 00:35:09,802
Tyra: ALMOST DEFENDED HIM.

1017
00:35:09,802 --> 00:35:11,104
I LIKE IT.

1018
00:35:11,104 --> 00:35:12,805
NEXT WE HAVE NICOLE.

1019
00:35:12,805 --> 00:35:14,741
LOOKS LIKE YOU WERE AT A SCHOOL
DANCE, TAKING PICTURES.

1020
00:35:14,741 --> 00:35:16,175
LIKE, "HEY!"

1021
00:35:16,175 --> 00:35:17,710
Nigel: THAT'S KINDA COOL.

1022
00:35:17,710 --> 00:35:19,679
Nolé: NOW SEE I LIKE THE LEGS
IN THIS POSITION HERE.

1023
00:35:19,679 --> 00:35:20,880
I THINK IT'S KIND OF CUTE.

1024
00:35:20,880 --> 00:35:22,282
IT WORKS--
GORGEOUS.

1025
00:35:22,282 --> 00:35:23,683
Janice:
VERY GOOD.

1026
00:35:23,683 --> 00:35:25,118
Tyra: THE STRONGEST PICTURE
IN THE BUNCH.

1027
00:35:25,118 --> 00:35:26,319
ALL RIGHT, YAYA.

1028
00:35:26,319 --> 00:35:27,954
Janice: HELLO.
NAIL.

1029
00:35:27,954 --> 00:35:29,022
Tyra: WHEN THAT LEG
WENT UP,

1030
00:35:29,022 --> 00:35:31,157
CHILD, I WAS LIKE,
"WHOA. I LIKE IT."

1031
00:35:31,157 --> 00:35:32,292
Matthew: I WAS LOOKING
AT A DANCER SOMETIMES,

1032
00:35:32,292 --> 00:35:34,060
NOT A MODEL.

1033
00:35:34,060 --> 00:35:35,395
Tyra: HERE'S YOUR
BEST SHOT.

1034
00:35:35,395 --> 00:35:36,963
Janice: THIS IS
MY FAVORITE PHOTOGRAPH.

1035
00:35:36,963 --> 00:35:38,131
Tyra: I AGREE
WITH MATTHEW

1036
00:35:38,131 --> 00:35:40,033
ABOUT THE DANCER VERSUS
THE MODEL THING.

1037
00:35:40,033 --> 00:35:41,334
I'M SAYING INSTEAD OF...
♪ LA ♪♪

1038
00:35:41,334 --> 00:35:43,136
IT'S...

1039
00:35:43,136 --> 00:35:45,071
Yaya: I'M GLAD I DIDN'T DO
THE OTHER POSE I WAS THINKING.

1040
00:35:45,071 --> 00:35:46,139
Janice: THAT WOULD'VE BEEN
MESSED UP.

1041
00:35:46,139 --> 00:35:47,407
Tyra: NEXT WE HAVE ANN.

1042
00:35:47,407 --> 00:35:49,876
Nolé: ANN, I'VE TITLED YOU
MY "ORGASMIC LETDOWN."

1043
00:35:49,876 --> 00:35:52,912
BECAUSE WHEN I SEE YOU,
I AM SO EXCITED ABOUT YOU.

1044
00:35:52,912 --> 00:35:55,648
BUT EVERY TIME I SEE YOUR PHOTOS
I'M LIKE, "YES! YES!

1045
00:35:55,648 --> 00:35:57,650
(gasps)
"NO."

1046
00:35:57,650 --> 00:35:59,185
Nigel: THE BIGGEST PROBLEM
I HAVE WITH THIS PICTURE

1047
00:35:59,185 --> 00:36:00,720
IS NOT THAT
IT'S BAD.

1048
00:36:00,720 --> 00:36:02,989
IT'S JUST THAT IT'S NOT
THE BEST YOU CAN DO.

1049
00:36:02,989 --> 00:36:05,058
Matthew: AND JAY REALLY
GOT ON YOU FOR A REASON.

1050
00:36:05,058 --> 00:36:06,793
AND AFTER HE PUSHED YOU,
WE GOT THAT.

1051
00:36:06,793 --> 00:36:08,661
Nigel: YOU KNOW,
YOU NEED TO BE POWERFUL.

1052
00:36:08,661 --> 00:36:09,962
YOU NEED TO BE
EXCITING.

1053
00:36:09,962 --> 00:36:11,264
JUST LOOK AT THESE TWO WOMEN
ON EITHER SIDE OF ME.

1054
00:36:11,264 --> 00:36:13,066
BOTH OF THEM
ARE EXCITING, POWERFUL,

1055
00:36:13,066 --> 00:36:14,067
YOU WANNA BE
AROUND THEM.

1056
00:36:14,067 --> 00:36:14,901
THEY'VE GOT
THAT ENERGY.

1057
00:36:14,901 --> 00:36:15,968
YOU NEED
TO HAVE THAT.

1058
00:36:15,968 --> 00:36:17,303
Tyra: I'VE SEEN YOU.

1059
00:36:17,303 --> 00:36:19,706
YOU KNOW,
I'VE SEEN THIS POWERFUL GIRL.

1060
00:36:19,706 --> 00:36:20,673
PUT IT THERE.

1061
00:36:20,673 --> 00:36:22,108
Nigel: YEAH.

1062
00:36:22,108 --> 00:36:23,376
Tyra: NEXT
WE HAVE AMANDA.

1063
00:36:23,376 --> 00:36:25,411
I FEEL FIRE PULSING
