1065
00:36:27,313 --> 00:36:28,748
Tyra: HERE'S
YOUR BEST SHOT.

1066
00:36:28,748 --> 00:36:29,849
Nigel: OH,
I LOVE IT.

1067
00:36:29,849 --> 00:36:31,417
Janice: THAT'S
FABULOUS.

1068
00:36:31,417 --> 00:36:33,219
Tyra: WAIT TILL YOU SEE
