1076
00:36:45,098 --> 00:36:46,332
Nolé: YOU LOOK
KIND OF EMPTY.

1077
00:36:46,332 --> 00:36:47,700
THERE'S NO FEELING.

1078
00:36:47,700 --> 00:36:48,801
YOU'RE NOT
IN THERE.

1079
00:36:48,801 --> 00:36:50,002
