ALL THE TIME.

1081
00:36:52,071 --> 00:36:53,406
Tyra: KELLE.

1082
00:36:53,406 --> 00:36:54,807
Nigel: YOU WERE VERY BOSSY
WITH THAT MALE MODEL.

1083
00:36:54,807 --> 00:36:56,042
AND YOU KNOW WHAT?

1084
00:36:56,042 --> 00:36:57,677
YOU DID
INTIMIDATE HIM,

1085
00:36:57,677 --> 00:36:59,345
AND THE FUNNY THING IS,
THESE ARE HIS WORST PICTURES.

1086
00:36:59,345 --> 00:37:00,880
