YOU WERE THE ONLY GIRL

1087
00:37:00,880 --> 00:37:03,216
THAT TRIED TO DO SOMETHING
AS EXOTIC AS THIS.

1088
00:37:03,216 --> 00:37:05,084
UM, THOUGH AS YOU CAN SEE,
