1089
00:37:05,084 --> 00:37:06,085
Kelle: YEAH.

1090
00:37:06,085 --> 00:37:07,787
Tyra: HERE IS
YOUR BEST SHOT.

1091
00:37:07,787 --> 00:37:09,655
