1093
00:37:11,090 --> 00:37:12,191
Tyra: I THINK YOUR FACE
IS PRETTY.

1094
00:37:12,191 --> 00:37:13,893
THIS WAS THE BEST
OF THE WORST.

1095
00:37:13,893 --> 00:37:18,097
