IN EACH PHOTOGRAPH.

1096
00:37:21,634 --> 00:37:22,869
Tyra: ANN.

1097
00:37:22,869 --> 00:37:23,903
Janice: SHE'S SO
BEAUTIFUL.

1098
00:37:23,903 --> 00:37:24,904
Nolé: BUT IN A PHOTO?

1099
00:37:24,904 --> 00:37:26,372
