A BIG LOSER.

1100
00:37:26,372 --> 00:37:27,940
Tyra: THIS IS
A PRETTY PICTURE.

1101
00:37:27,940 --> 00:37:31,077
BUT PRETTY DON'T MAKE YOU BUY
DOONEY & BOURKE PURSES.

1102
00:37:31,077 --> 00:37:32,178
NORELLE.

1103
00:37:32,178 --> 00:37:33,312
Nigel: SHE LOOKS DYNAMITE.

1104
00:37:33,312 --> 00:37:34,714
Janice: THIS IS
HER ONLY LOOK.

1105
00:37:34,714 --> 00:37:35,782
Tyra: YAYA.

1106
00:37:35,782 --> 00:37:37,917
Janice: THIS PHOTOGRAPH
JUST ROCKS.

1107
00:37:37,917 --> 00:37:40,953
Nigel: BUT FOR ME, IT'S STILL
TOO DANCER, DANCER, DANCER.

1108
00:37:40,953 --> 00:37:42,088
Tyra: CASSIE.

1109
00:37:42,088 --> 00:37:43,156
Matthew: COLD FISH.

1110
00:37:43,156 --> 00:37:44,357
Nolé: I FIND HER
HOT AS HELL.

1111
00:37:44,357 --> 00:37:45,391
Tyra: SHE'S SELLABLE.

1112
00:37:45,391 --> 00:37:47,026
SHE'S VERY
SELLABLE.

1113
00:37:47,026 --> 00:37:48,694
TOCCARA.

1114
00:37:48,694 --> 00:37:50,229
