IT'S DEAD.

1116
00:37:51,764 --> 00:37:52,932
Janice: SHE'S
GOTTA GO.

1117
00:37:52,932 --> 00:37:53,966
Tyra: SO YOU'RE GONNA THROW
SOMEBODY AWAY

1118
00:37:53,966 --> 00:37:55,301
BECAUSE THEY HAVE
ONE BAD SHOT?

1119
00:37:55,301 --> 00:37:56,769
Janice: YES.

1120
00:37:56,769 --> 00:37:58,037
Tyra: EVA.

1121
00:37:58,037 --> 00:38:00,006
Nolé: EVA HAS ONE OF
THE MOST INCREDIBLE FACES HERE.

1122
00:38:00,006 --> 00:38:04,177
Tyra: SHE DEFINITELY HAS
A STAR POWER IN PERSON.

1123
00:38:04,177 --> 00:38:08,214
