BUT EVA'S NOT GREAT.

1124
00:38:08,214 --> 00:38:09,916
Janice: EXACTLY.

1125
00:38:09,916 --> 00:38:11,284
Tyra: NICOLE.

1126
00:38:11,284 --> 00:38:12,652
Nigel: NICOLE LOOKS FANTASTIC
IN THIS PICTURE.

1127
00:38:12,652 --> 00:38:14,086
Matthew: SHE HAS A TWINKLE
